                               <tag>  tag    <tag
numbered   (?(1)>)             yes    yes    no
named      (?(open)>)          yes    yes    no
PCRE named (?(<open>)>)        compile error
lookaround (?(?=<)<\w+>|\w+)   compile error
DEFINE     (?(DEFINE)...)      compile error
no such group (a)(?(2)x|y)     compile error

then someone adds an optional numeric prefix in front of it:
numbered   (?(1)>)             no     yes    yes
named      (?(open)>)          yes    yes    no
